## ⚡ Redis Caching (Automatic Degradation)

### Smart Caching

```javascript
// If Redis unavailable, still works!
const cached = await cache.get(key); // Returns null safely
await cache.set(key, value); // Fails gracefully

// App continues without caching
```

### Cache Patterns

```javascript
// Cache-aside (most common)
async getUser(id) {
  // 1. Check cache
  const cached = await cache.get(`user:${id}`);
  if (cached) return cached;
  
  // 2. Fetch from DB
  const user = await db.get(id);
  
  // 3. Store in cache
  await cache.set(`user:${id}`, user, 3600);
  
  return user;
}

// Cache invalidation
async updateUser(id, data) {
  const user = await db.update(id, data);
  
  // Invalidate cache
  await cache.delete(`user:${id}`);
  
  return user;
}
```

